I just ascended one. Before the Quest they're hard, but afterwards they're
very easy; the PYEC means you can accumulate a large supply of WoDeath
zaps and use them more freely, you don't have to wish for or burn marker
charges on scrolls of charging, etc.

Early on, it's just a matter of using all your resources. Use the darts
now, it's better than dying with them, and you'll get more darts from
kobolds to tide you over until you build up a decent stack of daggers.
Practice with daggers, and use them as your second throwing weapon. I was
lucky enough to get Magicbane about 10,000 moves in, so could easily
practice the dagger skill. Use the camera to escape - expect to escape a
lot, and to use your pet extensively. Tame more pets if you can. Rob all
shopkeepers blind, and price-ID the stuff you get. Make a quick trip into
the Mines to try and get a mithril coat and boots/helm/shield, maybe
descend to the Mine Town and clear out the shops.
